    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to present 2 Belgrave View to the market. This ground floor one-bedroom apartment offers an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a property with scope for modernisation in a well-established Dublin 6 location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen, double bedroom and bathroom. The property would benefit from some updating but offers good potential for a purchaser to put their own stamp on the apartment.\r\n\r\nThe location is excellent, with Rathmines, Ranelagh and Rathgar all within easy reach. Rathmines and Ranelagh villages are is approximately a 5-minute walk and the Beechwood Luas stop approximately 7 minutes. There is a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and bars nearby, along with Swan Leisure, Rathmines Omniplex, Belgrave Square and Dartmouth Square and the city centre is easily accessible by foot, Luas or Dublin Bus.\r\n\r\nAn ideal first home, investment or refurbishment opportunity in a highly sought-after Dublin 6 location."
      },
      {
